                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16121fdf-741d-43d0-ba5d-f16387b93bb1",
                                "sense_id": "23221926-9f13-3ed0-90d5-75a9fb672eeb",
                                "text": "— Да, вот и у нас в гимна́зии дире́ктор вся́кую шу́шеру пуска́ет, — серди́то сказа́л Передо́нов, — да́же есть крестья́нские де́ти, а меща́н да́же мно́го.",
                                "translation": "\" Here, for instance, our Head-Master lets all sorts of riff-raff into the school,\" said Peredonov angrily. \" There are even peasant children there and many commoners' children.\"",
                                "english": "\" Here, for instance, our Head-Master lets all sorts of riff-raff into the school,\" said Peredonov angrily. \" There are even peasant children there and many commoners' children.\""
                            }
                        ]
